{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BZez6rdPgsFGTqwijhfihX","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Taiwan news November 10 2026\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Taiwan News\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_News\"},{\"title\":\"Front Page - Taipei Times\",\"url\":\"https://www.taipeitimes.com/News/front\"},{\"title\":\"Taiwan News - Voice of the People, Bridge to the World\",\"url\":\"https://www.taiwannews.com.tw/\"},{\"title\":\"Taiwan Journal\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_Journal\"},{\"title\":\"TVBS News\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TVBS_News\"},{\"title\":\"Taiwan Daily\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_Daily\"},{\"title\":\"TaiwanPlus\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TaiwanPlus\"},{\"title\":\"Taiwan News\",\"url\":\"https://www.newsnow.co.uk/h/World+News/Asia/Taiwan\"},{\"title\":\"Focus Taiwan - CNA English News\",\"url\":\"https://focustaiwan.tw/\"}]\n\nThe search didn't turn up anything dated specifically to November 10, 2026, so these are the most recent items I found, from roughly November 6 to 10.\n\n- **Markets:** Taiwan's government ordered its financial regulator to stabilize the stock market after a large sell-off. Taiwan today ordered the financial regulator to \"stabilize\" the stock market (dated November 6). Shares in Taiwanese chipmaking giant Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Co (TSMC, 台積電) plummeted as much as 9.8 percent in that sell-off.\n- **Nvidia:** A Taipei Times item dated November 9 says the Nvidia investigation into CEO Jensen Huang over an alleged affair with a Chinese spy is unlikely to have a major impact on Taiwan's artificial intelligence (AI) supply chain, according to a think-tank president.\n- **Legislature:** Prosecutors indicted independent legislator May Chin and three aides over alleged Chinese funding for organizations in Taiwan, seeking a 14-year prison sentence for Chin.\n- **Focus Taiwan (CNA), listed as current:** Headlines include a second batch of F-16V jets arrives in Taiwan, a military live-fire drill in Kinmen, and Taiwan's push for independent satellite launches.\n- **Other:** Taiwan is closing its office in Papua New Guinea, and a magnitude 4.2 earthquake hit central Taiwan, per Taiwan News.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c385d3b9-facd-4568-8e54-75f990759cf0","uuid":"267dbab0-5655-4850-b596-99a58a5bd532","timestamp":"2026-11-10T03:01:39.762Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Taiwan news November 10 2026","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01LCDKTcy5c5AhBSLTEiZxNM","content":[{"title":"Taiwan News","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_News"},{"title":"Front Page - Taipei Times","url":"https://www.taipeitimes.com/News/front"},{"title":"Taiwan News - Voice of the People, Bridge to the World","url":"https://www.taiwannews.com.tw/"},{"title":"Taiwan Journal","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_Journal"},{"title":"TVBS News","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TVBS_News"},{"title":"Taiwan Daily","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_Daily"},{"title":"TaiwanPlus","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TaiwanPlus"},{"title":"Taiwan News","url":"https://www.newsnow.co.uk/h/World+News/Asia/Taiwan"},{"title":"Focus Taiwan - CNA English News","url":"https://focustaiwan.tw/"}]},"The search didn't turn up anything dated specifically to November 10, 2026, so these are the most recent items I found, from roughly November 6 to 10.\n\n- **Markets:** Taiwan's government ordered its financial regulator to stabilize the stock market after a large sell-off. Taiwan today ordered the financial regulator to \"stabilize\" the stock market (dated November 6). Shares in Taiwanese chipmaking giant Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Co (TSMC, 台積電) plummeted as much as 9.8 percent in that sell-off.\n- **Nvidia:** A Taipei Times item dated November 9 says the Nvidia investigation into CEO Jensen Huang over an alleged affair with a Chinese spy is unlikely to have a major impact on Taiwan's artificial intelligence (AI) supply chain, according to a think-tank president.\n- **Legislature:** Prosecutors indicted independent legislator May Chin and three aides over alleged Chinese funding for organizations in Taiwan, seeking a 14-year prison sentence for Chin.\n- **Focus Taiwan (CNA), listed as current:** Headlines include a second batch of F-16V jets arrives in Taiwan, a military live-fire drill in Kinmen, and Taiwan's push for independent satellite launches.\n- **Other:** Taiwan is closing its office in Papua New Guinea, and a magnitude 4.2 earthquake hit central Taiwan, per Taiwan News."],"durationSeconds":6.0904769309999995,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01BZez6rdPgsFGTqwijhfihX","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
